{"type": "say", "text": "Thanks everyone for joining. As we gear up for Saturday's search-index rollout, I want to make sure we're ready to publish the on-call roster and operating policy. Before I can sign off, I need each reviewing area — backend engineering, infrastructure, and customer support — to share their concrete findings on the current plan. The draft has Leo as primary, Marta as secondary, and Nina as escalation manager, with customer status updates every 60 minutes during any service degradation. Once I've heard your findings and approved a response or follow-up for each one, we'll be clear to publish. Who'd like to start?"}
```

