{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I have a finding from backend engineering. While checking permissions for an unrelated release this afternoon, I discovered that Leo's schema-rollback access expired during the last access review. Marta still has current rollback access. I haven't filed the access ticket yet. Given that Leo is named as primary on-call for Saturday's rollout, this is a gap we need to address before publishing the roster."}
```

